    "  • Standard tier: Only critical + warning",
    "",
    "📊 Loading alerts for dependencies: elasticsearch",
    "  ✓ elasticsearch: 17 alerts (9 fixed)",
    "",
    "✅ Generated 17 total alerts",
    "  Breakdown: elasticsearch=17",
